  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Saber** (_to know_) and **caber** (_to fit_) are irregular in the conditional because their stems are irregular: the **e** of the infinitive disappears. The endings are the regular conditional ones."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**sabr-** / **cabr-**",
            "**-ía, -ías, -ía, -íamos, -ían**"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "saber",
            "caber"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "sabría",
              "cabría"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "sabrías",
              "cabrías"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "sabría",
              "cabría"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "sabríamos",
              "cabríamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "sabrían",
              "cabrían"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Caber** is about physical space: what fits where. **Saber** is _to know_ something, or _to know how_ to do something (**saber** + infinitive)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: both lose their **e** to squeeze in: **cab-r-ía** fits better, **sab-r-ía** knows it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Yo ==cabría== en ese traje de neopreno.",
              "en": "I'd fit in that wetsuit."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tú no ==cabrías== en el elevador con la tabla.",
              "en": "You wouldn't fit in the elevator with the board."
            },
            {
              "es": "Nosotros ==cabríamos== en el taxi.",
              "en": "We'd fit in the cab."
            },
            {
              "es": "Las chamarras no ==cabrían== en esa maleta.",
              "en": "The jackets wouldn't fit in that suitcase."
            },
            {
              "es": "Yo ==sabría== abrir ese carro sin llave.",
              "en": "I'd know how to open that car without a key."
            },
            {
              "es": "El profe no ==sabría== nada de eso.",
              "en": "The teacher wouldn't know anything about that."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ustedes ==sabrían== todas las respuestas.",
              "en": "You'd know all the answers."
            }
          ]
        }
